OL,16,     GThe RTV Slovenia Symphony
OL,17,     GOrchestra plays Bach and Mozart's
OL,18,     G'Jupiter' Symphony. Organist
OL,19,     GOlivier Latry and timpanist Petra
OL,20,     GVidmar join the ensemble for
OL,21,     GPoulenc's concerto.
